# Title: Office Macro File Creation From Suspicious Process
# ID: b1c50487-1967-4315-a026-6491686d860e
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: frack113, Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-01-23
# Tags: attack.initial-access, attack.t1566.001
# Description: Detects the creation of a office macro file from a a suspicious process
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((process.executable:*\\cscript.exe OR process.executable:*\\mshta.exe OR process.executable:*\\regsvr32.exe OR process.executable:*\\rundll32.exe OR process.executable:*\\wscript.exe)) OR ((process.parent.executable:*\\cscript.exe OR process.parent.executable:*\\mshta.exe OR process.parent.executable:*\\regsvr32.exe OR process.parent.executable:*\\rundll32.exe OR process.parent.executable:*\\wscript.exe))) AND ((file.path:*.docm OR file.path:*.dotm OR file.path:*.xlsm OR file.path:*.xltm OR file.path:*.potm OR file.path:*.pptm)))
